{"status":"ready","content":"I need to divide 123456789012345 by 98765.\r\n\r\nLet me perform this division step by step.\r\n\r\n123456789012345 ÷ 98765\r\n\r\nFirst, I'll find how many times 98765 goes into 123456789012345.\r\n\r\n98765 × 1,000,000,000 = 98,765,000,000,000\r\n\r\nThis is less than 123,456,789,012,345, so let me estimate:\r\n\r\n123,456,789,012,345 ÷ 98,765 ≈ 1,250,000,000 (rough estimate)\r\n\r\nLet me calculate more precisely:\r\n\r\n98765 × 1,250,000,000 = 123,456,250,000,000\r\n\r\nSubtracting: 123,456,789,012,345 - 123,456,250,000,000 = 539,012,345\r\n\r\nNow divide 539,012,345 by 98765:\r\n98765 × 5,000 = 493,825,000\r\n539,012,345 - 493,825,000 = 45,187,345\r\n\r\n98765 × 400 = 39,506,000\r\n45,187,345 - 39,506,000 = 5,681,345\r\n\r\n98765 × 57 = 5,629,605\r\n5,681,345 - 5,629,605 = 51,740\r\n\r\nSo the quotient is: 1,250,000,000 + 5,000 + 400 + 57 = **1,250,005,457**\r\n\r\nAnd the remainder is: **51,740**\r\n\r\n**Verification:** 98765 × 1,250,005,457 + 51,740 = 123,456,789,012,345 ✓\r\n","path":"responses/claude-opus-4-5/large-division.txt","size":941,"mtime":1778576724}